==> 0/7 — Preflight
    required tools present; Docker daemon reachable

==> Scenario — healthy-fleet
    the control plane, CRDs, and scheduler are identical for every scenario.
    
    LIVE mode (default): sim-robot-001 will be driven by a real sim_adapter.py process
    against the real ControlStream (--scenario healthy-fleet). The other two
    robots stay status-projected — they have no Fleet Adapter, so nothing can
    ever drive their readiness the real way.
    sim-robot-001's connection, registration, telemetry, AND phase are all real:
    the Robot reconciler advances a live robot Discovered->Idle on its own
    (ADR-0029). See docs/quickstart.md, Honest notes.
    This deploys via config/overlays/quickstart-mtls (DEV/DEMO ONLY — see
    that overlay's own header comment).

